iends of the Museum of the Macedonian Struggle” that was founded in 1993 in the Municipality of Kastoria.", "original_document_number": 6}, {"doc_id": "ramdocs-0450-408b6571110b:d08", "card_id": "ramdocs-0450-408b6571110b:d08:c0", "entity": "Museum for the Macedonian Struggle", "scope": "establishment date", "claim": "The Museum for the Macedonian Struggle was established in 1989.", "answer": "1989", "quote": "The museum was founded in 1989 by the Letters", "original_document_number": 9}, {"doc_id": "ramdocs-0450-408b6571110b:d10", "card_id": "ramdocs-0450-408b6571110b:d10:c0", "entity": "Museum for the Macedonian Struggle", "scope": "establishment date", "claim": "The Museum for the Macedonian Struggle was established in 1989.", "answer": "1989", "quote": "was founded in 1989 by the Letters and Arts Association of Kozani in commemoration of the February 1878 uprising , which took place in the region aiming to abrogate the treaty of San Stefano .", "original_document_number": 11}], "fallible_previous_answer": ["1980", "1955", "1920"]}
